{"id":"rund","lemma":"rund","pos":"adj","rank":2021,"glosses":["circular","spherical, globular","corpulent, thick"],"ipa":"/rʊnt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/De-rund.ogg/De-rund.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"runder","superlative":"am rundesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Die Erde ist rund.","en":"The earth is round.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"earth"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Es ist wahr, dass die Erde rund ist.","en":"It is true that the earth is round.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823184","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"true, real"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"earth"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Er isst rund um die Uhr.","en":"He eats around the clock.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to eat","l":"essen"},null,{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hours, o'clock"}]},{"text":"Ich möchte rund um die Welt reisen.","en":"I'd like to travel around the world.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},null,{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"world"},{"g":"to travel"}]},{"text":"Genau genommen ist die Erde nicht rund.","en":"Strictly speaking, the earth is not round.","words":[null,null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"earth"},{"g":"not"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"strictly speaking"]]}]}